442
00:28:09.399 --> 00:28:10.359
<i>And that was it.</i>

443
00:28:10.479 --> 00:28:12.399
<i>Because of a stupid fight I was done.</i>

444
00:28:14.159 --> 00:28:15.719
<i>I had to support myself.</i>

445
00:28:16.079 --> 00:28:18.479
<i>I couldn't rely on Mr Robertson's promise
