446
00:28:18.800 --> 00:28:21.719
<i>- You're a witch?
- That's what I've been trying to tell you.</i>

447
00:28:22.159 --> 00:28:24.039
<i>To earn money I worked as a mother's helper.</i>

448
00:28:26.080 --> 00:28:28.439
<i>This family simply wanted a cheap servant.</i>

449
00:28:33.639 --> 00:28:35.999
<i>That was when
I first discovered confession stories.</i>

450
00:28:37.600 --> 00:28:39.176
<i>I didn't care if they were real or fake.</i>

451
00:28:39.200 --> 00:28:40.720
<i>It was a great way to pass the time.</i>

452
00:28:43.600 --> 00:28:45.079
<i>I did housework during the day</i>

453
00:28:46.399 --> 00:28:47.679
<i>and went to school at night.</i>

454
00:28:48.400 --> 00:28:50.359
<i>When eating in formal situations,</i>

455
00:28:50.679 --> 00:28:52.415
rest your knife and your fork on the plate

456
00:28:52.439 --> 00:28:53.896
